Output demo/demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 560
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "rm -rf /tmp/r3-demo-data && mkdir -p /tmp/r3-demo-data && node demo/demo.mjs > /dev/null 2>&1; rm -rf /tmp/r3-demo-data/data && clear"
Enter
Sleep 60s
Show

Type "node demo/demo.mjs"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 15s
